    model:["Turn the story engine into six beats.","Draw stick figures and arrows instead of detailed art.","Write action and dialogue below each panel.","Check that something changes from one panel to the next."],
    say:"A storyboard is a thinking tool, not an art contest. Clear beats beat perfect drawings.",
