    cfu:{q:"What makes a panel an important beat?",choices:["It has detailed coloring","Something meaningful changes","It contains the title","It uses a close-up"],correct:1,explain:"A beat moves information, emotion, or action forward."},
    exit:"Which panel is your turning point, and what changes because of it?",stem:"Panel ___ is the turning point because…",
    materials:"Storyboard paper, pencils, erasers.",teacher:"Stop students from over-drawing panel one. Timebox each sketch to protect planning momentum.",lookFor:"Panels show cause and effect and include an identifiable turning point."
