    cfu:{q:"Which detail best shows impatience?",choices:["The character is named Max","The character taps a foot and interrupts the countdown","The character wears blue","The character lives nearby"],correct:1,explain:"The repeated visible action provides evidence of the trait."},
    exit:"What specific action will reveal your character’s personality in the story?",stem:"The audience will understand ___ when my character…",
    materials:"Paper, pencils, optional mirrors for expression study.",teacher:"Ask “What would I see?” whenever students answer with an abstract trait only.",lookFor:"Character choices and poses visibly support named traits."
