    exit:"Choose one panel and justify its shot type using what the audience needs to know.",stem:"I chose a ___ shot because the audience needs to notice…",
    materials:"Storyboards, paper viewfinders, projector.",teacher:"Require purpose, not variety for its own sake. Repeated wide shots may be correct if the setting matters.",lookFor:"Students link framing to information or emotion."
