    exit:"What cue tells your second character when to speak?",stem:"My second character begins when…",
    materials:"Scratch devices, storyboards, cue cards.",teacher:"Check reading time aloud; students often underestimate how long text needs to remain visible.",lookFor:"Dialogue has a clear speaker order and readable duration."
