    exit:"What revision did you choose, and what viewer evidence made it important?",stem:"I revised ___ because my tester…",
    materials:"Scratch projects or storyboards, feedback forms, pencils.",teacher:"Keep creators silent during the first minute of testing so they can observe the real user experience.",lookFor:"Revisions connect directly to observed evidence."
